Package: luci-app-trusted
Version: 1.3.0-1
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Maintainer: junwelee
Description: Trusted IP whitelist for passwordless LuCI, terminal and SSH access
 Whitelisted IPv4 addresses access the LuCI web interface, the ttyd web
 terminal and SSH without entering a username and password.  The passwordless
 terminal and the passwordless SSH login are independent switches, and
 non-whitelisted devices keep their normal password login unless the optional
 "deny non-whitelisted devices" switch is enabled.
 .
 Requires LuCI (luci-base) and ucode, which ship with every standard LuCI
 firmware image. Dependencies are intentionally not declared: this package
 contains no binaries and must also install on images whose opkg status
 database is empty.
